  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "gaja_overview",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "character_identity",
      "title": "Gaja Overview: The Bipedal Elephant & Heavyweight Anchor",
      "text": "Character: Gaja (gaja). Title: The Bipedal Elephant & Heavyweight Anchor. Cultural Motif: Gaja (Airavata / Gajendra). Visual Design: Stout, friendly bipedal baby elephant standing on two sturdy hind legs. Large expressive floppy ears, raised curved trunk expressing joy, slate blue-grey skin, and warm terracotta inner ears. Blank runtime badge on chest. Role in Bubble Sort: Heavyweight / Anchor Element. 3D Mesh: gaja.glb, Height: 1.25m."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "gaja_culture",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "cultural_heritage",
      "title": "Gaja Cultural Heritage & Motif",
      "text": "Gaja (gaja) is inspired by Gaja (Airavata / Gajendra). Cultural Significance: In Indian heritage, the elephant embodies profound memory, patience, wisdom, and unyielding physical presence. It signifies grounded stability and venerable steadiness.. Visual characteristics: Stout, friendly bipedal baby elephant standing on two sturdy hind legs. Large expressive floppy ears, raised curved trunk expressing joy, slate blue-grey skin, and warm terracotta inner ears. Blank runtime badge on chest. The character connects computer science education with India's rich intellectual and craft traditions."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "gaja_algorithm",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "bubble_sort_pedagogy",
      "title": "Gaja Bubble Sort Algorithm & Educational Function",
      "text": "In Bubble Sort, Gaja (gaja) acts as the Heavyweight / Anchor Element. Sorting behavior: When an array item has a high numeric value, Bubble Sort causes it to steadily 'bubble up' to the right end of the array pass-by-pass. Gaja represents this heavyweight element: with each comparison pass, Gaja hops decisively across smaller elements until reaching the final sorted partition. Animation reactions during execution: GlanceL: Turns trunk and eyes left to inspect the neighbouring array element value. GlanceR: Turns trunk and eyes right to compare numeric values. Hop: Powerful vertical bipedal leap with flapping ears as the slot coordinates swap. NoSwap: Nods knowingly and stays put when the adjacent element is already smaller. Success: Trumpets trunk high in victory with a joyful ear flap when the array is sorted."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "gaja_3d_specs",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "3d_technical_specs",
      "title": "Gaja 3D Asset & Rigging Specs",
      "text": "Gaja (gaja) 3D Model Specifications: mesh=gaja.glb, height=1.25 meters, base armature='14-bone standard biped core', accessory bones=trunk.01, trunk.02, trunk.03, ear.L, ear.R, materials=gaja_skin_rough, gaja_ear_terracotta, badge_slate_cream, triangle budget=< 12000 triangles. Includes blank runtime badge plate for dynamic number projection."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "mayur_overview",
      "character_id": "mayur",
      "category": "character_identity",
      "title": "Mayur Overview: The Peacock Chick & Pattern Comparator",
      "text": "Character: Mayur (mayur). Title: The Peacock Chick & Pattern Comparator. Cultural Motif: Mayura (Peacock). Visual Design: Plump teal/cerulean bird chick standing on two slender clawed legs. Features a triple-feather head crest and a wide radial fan of emerald green and golden feathers adorned with shimmering indigo eye-spots. Role in Bubble Sort: Comparison & Pattern Verification Pointer. 3D Mesh: mayur.glb, Height: 1.1m."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "mayur_culture",
      "character_id": "mayur",
      "category": "cultural_heritage",
      "title": "Mayur Cultural Heritage & Motif",
      "text": "Mayur (mayur) is inspired by Mayura (Peacock). Cultural Significance: The national bird of India, Mayura symbolizes beauty, sacred vigilance, cyclical rebirth, and radiant celestial geometry. Its fanned plumage is a traditional symbol of completeness and discernment.. Visual characteristics: Plump teal/cerulean bird chick standing on two slender clawed legs. Features a triple-feather head crest and a wide radial fan of emerald green and golden feathers adorned with shimmering indigo eye-spots. The character connects computer science education with India's rich intellectual and craft traditions."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "mayur_algorithm",
      "character_id": "mayur",
      "category": "bubble_sort_pedagogy",
      "title": "Mayur Bubble Sort Algorithm & Educational Function",
      "text": "In Bubble Sort, Mayur (mayur) acts as the Comparison & Pattern Verification Pointer. Sorting behavior: Mayur serves as the dynamic visual comparator. The expansive tail fan folds inward during fast travel and fans outward into a breathtaking radial arc during element inspection and victorious sort completion. Animation reactions during execution: GlanceL: Tilts head crest and cocks beak leftward to scrutinize the left neighbour. GlanceR: Pecks and glances rightward during pairwise comparison. Hop: Nimble, fluttery hop in place with tail feathers rustling. NoSwap: Gentle preening flutter indicating the adjacent pair is in ascending order. Success: Magnificent full tail fan expansion with high-frequency plumage shiver."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "mayur_3d_specs",
      "character_id": "mayur",
      "category": "3d_technical_specs",
      "title": "Mayur 3D Asset & Rigging Specs",
      "text": "Mayur (mayur) 3D Model Specifications: mesh=mayur.glb, height=1.1 meters, base armature='14-bone standard biped core', accessory bones=tailFan_root, tailFan.L, tailFan.R, crest.top, beak, materials=peacock_blue_satin, feather_emerald_gold, badge_slate_cream, triangle budget=< 14500 triangles. Includes blank runtime badge plate for dynamic number projection."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "diya_overview",
      "character_id": "diya",
      "category": "character_identity",
      "title": "Diya Overview: The Terracotta Lamp & Traversal Pointer",
      "text": "Character: Diya (diya). Title: The Terracotta Lamp & Traversal Pointer. Cultural Motif: Diya / Deepa (Clay Oil Lamp). Visual Design: Chubby terracotta clay bowl with a pinched pouring spout, short stubby clay arms and feet, and a warm glowing teardrop flame crest alive on top. A radiant amber gem rests on its cheek. Role in Bubble Sort: Active Traversal Pointer & Invariance Validator. 3D Mesh: diya.glb, Height: 0.85m."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "diya_culture",
      "character_id": "diya",
      "category": "cultural_heritage",
      "title": "Diya Cultural Heritage & Motif",
      "text": "Diya (diya) is inspired by Diya / Deepa (Clay Oil Lamp). Cultural Significance: The clay lamp symbolizes the triumph of light over darkness and knowledge over ignorance (Tamaso ma jyotir gamaya). It represents inner focus, truth, and persistent clarity.. Visual characteristics: Chubby terracotta clay bowl with a pinched pouring spout, short stubby clay arms and feet, and a warm glowing teardrop flame crest alive on top. A radiant amber gem rests on its cheek. The character connects computer science education with India's rich intellectual and craft traditions."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "diya_algorithm",
      "character_id": "diya",
      "category": "bubble_sort_pedagogy",
      "title": "Diya Bubble Sort Algorithm & Educational Function",
      "text": "In Bubble Sort, Diya (diya) acts as the Active Traversal Pointer & Invariance Validator. Sorting behavior: In Bubble Sort, an inner loop pointer traverses adjacent pairs [j, j+1]. Diya acts as the radiant searchlight of the algorithm: its flame glows brighter during active comparison and turns steady gold once its element is locked into its invariant sorted position. Animation reactions during execution: GlanceL: Pivots flame and warm eyes left, illuminating the left slot. GlanceR: Spill of warm light rightward toward the comparison target. Hop: Energetic bobbing bounce with the flame flexing like a teardrop. NoSwap: Flame pulses warm amber, confirming no inversion exists between pairs. Success: Flame flares into brilliant warm gold with joyful arm spinning."
    },
    {
